        "subject": "chore(ci): go a bit easier on the go bumps (#2043) (#2049)",
        "body": "* chore(ci): go a bit easier on the go bumps (#2043)\n\nSigned-off-by: Michael Crenshaw <350466+crenshaw-dev@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(ci): tidy go.mod after go-fix-maybe-bump early exits\n\nPass 1 can drop imports on the common path (same language floor as the\ntoolchain) and previously skipped go mod tidy. Also stop treating a\nfailed go fix as success before choosing a language floor.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nSigned-off-by: Michael Crenshaw <350466+crenshaw-dev@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Michael Crenshaw <350466+crenshaw-dev@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>",
